  "notes": "Replaces field-fragile ephemeral npx execution with a persistent app-owned pinned Wrangler package installed through the pinned portable Node/npm runtime, then invokes wrangler.js directly through node.exe. Exact portable Node archive + npm install + direct Wrangler execution is exercised on Windows CI. Keeps bounded retries, secret-free diagnostics, zero-dollar policy, and no manual runtime install, Telegram token re-entry, PowerShell, or ZIP shuttle."
